* A global label in a conditional, and one a macro makes, after an odd dc.b: at the statement's
* aligned address, as r68 puts it. Before, r68togas's macros for them put the label on a line of
* its own, and gas aligned only the statement after it: the label stayed on the odd address (a
* dbf to it branched there).
* fixed: 00efcd1 2026-10-18 r68togas: a global label in a conditional or a macro on its statement's line
* expect text: 6004 6162 6300 7202 51cc fffc 6400 7203 60fc 4e75
Flag_x equ 1
mk macro
\1: moveq #3,d1
 endm
 psect glab_odd,0,0,0,0,0
entry bra.s Lp
 dc.b "abc"
 ifne Flag_x
Lp: moveq #2,d1
 endc
 dbf d4,Lp
 dc.b "d"
 mk Mx
 bra.s Mx
 rts
 ends
